{{Quote|Suit up, boys. Time we paid a visit to one of the most dangerous systems in the galaxy. We're going to Kessel.|[[Hunter]], to [[Clone Force 99]]|<ref name="Ghost Agents 1">[[Hyperspace Stories: The Bad Batch—Ghost Agents 1|''Hyperspace Stories: The Bad Batch—Ghost Agents'' 1]]</ref>}}
The '''Kessel system''',<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> also known as the '''Kessa system''',<ref name="Hoth">{{EncyclopediaCite|Hoth and Other Planets in the Outer Rim}}</ref> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Kessel sector]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]] that contained the [[planet]]s [[Kessel]], which was renowned for its [[spice]] [[Spice mines of Kessel|mines]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />

